    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-speed puzzle action game for all ages, with a cute world view and stress-free operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The operation is simple, but it is a deep game where player skill is important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry, match, and stack! Let's make a tall pancake tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Deliver the pancake tower to the sky!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While chasing the moving cargo bed, you quickly carry food and make pancakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only carrying, but also the quick thinking to instantly decide which food to stack from the food on the spot is important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the recipe will generate a combo bonus and you can aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The performance after clearing is also a point of interest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try stacking pancakes high and high to make a giant pancake tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For all ages</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high-speed puzzle action game for all ages, with a cute world view and stress-free operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The operation is simple, but it is a deep game where player skill is important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry, match, and stack! Let's make a tall pancake tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Deliver the pancake tower to the sky!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While chasing the moving cargo bed, you quickly carry food and make pancakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only carrying, but also the quick thinking to instantly decide which food to stack from the food on the spot is important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing the recipe will generate a combo bonus and you can aim for a high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The performance after clearing is also a point of interest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try stacking pancakes high and high to make a giant pancake tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For all ages</p></li></ul>",
